-wei-complete:source_review16-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"9qd_qoj_hyt","source_quote":"永明元年冬，遣驍騎將軍劉纘、前軍將軍張謨使虜。明年冬，虜使李道固報聘，世祖於玄武湖水步軍講武，登龍舟引見之。自此歲使往來，疆埸無事。","reading":"劉纘張謨先使，李道固次冬報聘。殿本考證引魏紀李彪，字道固。","note":"劉纘張謨先使，李道固次冬報聘。殿本考證引魏紀李彪，字道固。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p016","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":66,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete-ws1999801"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:variant_review16-27","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"9qd_qoj_hyt","source_quote":"虜使李道固報聘","reading":"殿本考證引魏紀李彪。道固為李彪字；相同使聘原文對照。","note":"殿本考證引魏紀李彪。道固為李彪字；相同使聘原文對照。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p016","start_codepoint":27,"end_codepoint":34,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete-ws1999801"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p024:m0084","start":84,"end":87,"surface":"李道固","kind":"person","person_id":"9qd_qoj_hyt","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p024","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p024:m0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"9qd_qoj_hyt","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p024","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p016:m0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"李道固","kind":"person","person_id":"9qd_qoj_hyt","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p016","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p021:m0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"李道固","kind":"person","person_id":"9qd_qoj_hyt","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p021","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p024","text":"　　融假東出，世祖問融住在何處？融答曰：「臣陸處無屋，舟居非水。」後日上以問融從兄緒，緒曰：「融近東出，未有居止，權牽小船，於岸上住。」上大笑。虜中聞融名，上使融接北使李道固，就席，道固顧之而言曰：「張融是宋彭城長史張暢子不？」融嚬蹙久之，曰：「先君不幸，名達六夷。」豫章王大會賔僚，融食炙始行畢，行炙人便去，融欲求鹽蒜，口終不言，方搖食指，半日乃息。出入朝廷皆拭目驚觀之。八年，朝臣賀衆瑞公事，融扶入拜起，復爲有司所奏，見原。遷司徒右長史。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":58,"last_line":58,"raw_start":4596,"raw_end":4817,"raw_character_offsets":[4596,4597,4598,4599,4600,4601,4602,4603,4604,4605,4606,4607,4608,4609,4610,4611,4612,4613,4614,4615,4616,4617,4618,4619,4620,4621,4622,4623,4624,4625,4626,4627,4628,4629,4630,4631,4632,4633,4634,4635,4636,4637,4638,4639,4640,4641,4642,4643,4644,4645,4646,4647,4648,4649,4650,4651,4652,4653,4654,4655,4656,4657,4658,4659,4660,4661,4662,4663,4664,4665,4666,4667,4668,4669,4670,4671,4672,4673,4674,4675,4676,4677,4678,4679,4680,4681,4682,4683,4684,4685,4686,4687,4688,4689,4690,4691,4692,4693,4694,4695,4696,4697,4698,4699,4700,4701,4702,4703,4704,4705,4706,4707,4708,4709,4710,4711,4712,4713,4714,4715,4716,4717,4718,4719,4720,4721,4722,4723,4724,4725,4726,4727,4728,4729,4730,4731,4732,4733,4734,4735,4736,4737,4738,4739,4740,4741,4742,4743,4744,4745,4746,4747,4748,4749,4750,4751,4752,4753,4754,4755,4756,4757,4758,4759,4760,4761,4762,4763,4764,4765,4766,4767,4768,4769,4770,4771,4772,4773,4774,4775,4776,4777,4778,4779,4780,4781,4782,4783,4784,4785,4786,4787,4788,4789,4790,4791,4792,4793,4794,4795,4796,4797,4798,4